        @{ Id = 'ISM-1563'; Section = 'System-specific cyber security documentation'; Topic = 'Security assessment report'; Rev = '2'; Updated = 'Sep-26'; ML = 0; NC = $true; OS = $true; P = $true; S = $true; TS = $true; Text = 'At the conclusion of a security control assessment for a system, a security assessment report is produced by the assessor and covers: * the scope of the security control assessment * the system''s strengths and weaknesses * security risks associated with the operation of the system * the effectiveness of the implementation of security controls * any recommended remediation actions.' }
